CAPEC
-----

src/capec/schema/, src/capec/datamodel/ and project/ model the XML Schema of
the Common Attack Pattern Enumeration and Classification (CAPEC), version 3.5,
and the catalogue of CAPEC version 3.9, which The MITRE Corporation publishes
at https://capec.mitre.org/data/. They are this project's rendering, in its own
words, keeping the element names, attribute names and listed values that a
catalogue needs in order to validate. They are not MITRE's. CAPEC and the CAPEC
logo are trademarks of The MITRE Corporation.

upstream/ holds ap_schema_v3.5.xsd and capec_v3.9.xml, each identical to its
counterpart on that site, and scripts/check_upstream_release.py pins each by its
git object hash. The Terms of Use, https://capec.mitre.org/about/termsofuse.html,
authorise such copies provided that each reproduces MITRE's copyright designation
